{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜2號李澤欣（Scarlett）勇奪季軍！李澤欣於香港中文大學碩士畢業，報稱是可持續報告顧問，才貌雙全。本屆首輪面試時，李澤欣憑着靚樣一鳴驚人，一出場便成為全場目光，她的五官立體精緻，與韓國人氣女團IVE成員李瑞十分相似。 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">李澤欣口才同樣了得，在首輪面試自我介紹時，她指自己除了想當演員，還曾夢想成為太空人，令人印象深刻。李澤欣選港姐前曾拍攝過廣告和MV，視張曼玉為偶像。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"10021563-99cb-406e-882d-10cb3064.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026A7FI1VrRx51788102857.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"10021563-99cb-406e-882d-10cb3064.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c3361bdc-82de-4d16-918c-39e179de.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Bg27qLwXs31788102841.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c3361bdc-82de-4d16-918c-39e179de.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T15:19:09.871639+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}